he doc must not be hand-edited.\n\nCI: none configured (.github/workflows absent; `gh run list --repo coding-hermes/code-factory` returns []), so ci=SKIP is the honest value \u2014 not green, and not a failure to file.", "blocked_reason": "criterion 5 cannot be green from inside scripts/harness/*.sh: the conformance matrix has seven rows and only four adapters exist. Blocked on CF-372 (install-deepseek.sh + install-pi-agent.sh). Implementation 45bd4bd is on main and judged (run c8018623, passed=false)."}
 {"id":"CF-230","title":"Harness selection is data-driven: lane model family picks the harness, and the choice is recorded with its reason","status":"complete","priority":"P0","complexity":3,"reasoning":"specs/HARNESS-MATRIX.md §3: today nothing resolves a harness from a model — the node's provisioning decides which harness exists, and a directive that names another just fails. The owner's goal for task-router is the opposite: pick a claude model, get the claude harness; pick openai, get codex; with the foreman always on Hermes.","acceptance_criteria":"1. The resolution order directive > matrix > policy fallback is implemented in one place and unit-tested against the matrix table.\n2. Foreman lanes REFUSE any harness other than hermes (matrix I1), with a named failure.\n3. Every run records harness_selected, harness_reason (directive|matrix|fallback) and model_requested vs model_served; a fallback is never silent.\n4. A matrix entry whose harness is not installed FAILs with 'harness_unsupported: <name>; node has: <set>' rather than falling back silently, except where §3 says fallback is policy.","probe":null,"created_at":"2026-11-05T03:14:40Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T22:57:50Z","detail":{"fingerprint":"ca3383ec31c9bbf1ef13f451af447846492351e6f0a2aef63b10f54676d8bb12","evidence":[{"run_id":"86c1c325","ts":"2026-11-05T22:57:50Z","tree_fp":"ed0729b1f41c1ad658a62f695aadafe7ae29719d00b4f982957d40758caaa7fd","artifacts":[".gitreins/history/2026-11-05/86c1c325/verdict.json"]}]},"capability_tags":[],"commit_hash":"74d36cf2cfdae15680cbbffa7aa2167cf892a4f5","guard_result":"PASS","ci_result":"SKIP","worker_summary":"CF-230 complete at 74d36cf2cfdae15680cbbffa7aa2167cf892a4f5 (gitreins CF-230, verdict run 86c1c325, passed=true, evaluated 2026-11-05T22:57:22Z, commit bound to the implementation SHA). Landed: scripts/harness_resolve.py (stdlib-only resolver + CLI: --explain <model> with --lane/--lane-class/--directive-harness/--lane-harness/--node-harnesses/--shims/--matrix-file